          "_name": "content4",
          "_sourceTheme": "mobirise5",
          "_customHTML": "<section data-bs-version=\"5.1\" class=\"content4\" group=\"Content\" data-bg-video=\"{{bg.type == 'video'&&bg.value.url}}\" mbr-class=\"{\n    'mbr-fullscreen': fullScreen,\n    'mbr-parallax-background': bg.parallax}\">\n    <mbr-parameters>\n        <header>Size</header>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Full Screen\" name=\"fullScreen\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Full Width\" name=\"fullWidth\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Top\" name=\"paddingTop\" min=\"0\" max=\"10\" step=\"1\" value=\"1\" condition=\"fullScreen == false\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Bottom\" name=\"paddingBottom\" min=\"0\" max=\"10\" step=\"1\" value=\"0\" condition=\"fullScreen == false\">\n        <input type=\"range\" name=\"textWidth\" title=\"Width\" min=\"4\" max=\"12\" step=\"1\" value=\"11\">\n        <header>Show/Hide</header>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Title\" name=\"showTitle\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Subtitle\" name=\"showSubtitle\" checked>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Buttons\" name=\"showButtons\">\n        <header>Background</header>\n        <fieldset type=\"background\" name=\"bg\" parallax>\n            <input type=\"image\" title=\"Image\" value>\n            <input type=\"color\" title=\"Color\" value=\"#ffffff\" selected>\n            <input type=\"video\" title=\"Video\" value=\"https://vimeo.com/428046504\">\n        </fieldset>\n        <header condition=\"bg.type === 'video'\">Fallback Image</header>\n        <input type=\"image\" title=\"Fallback Image\" value name=\"fallBackImage\" condition=\"bg.type === 'video'\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Overlay\" name=\"overlay\" condition=\"bg.type !== 'color'\" checked>\n        <input type=\"color\" title=\"Overlay Color\" name=\"overlayColor\" value=\"#ffffff\" condition=\"overlay && bg.type !== 'color'\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Opacity\" name=\"overlayOpacity\" min=\"0\" max=\"1\" step=\"0.1\" value=\"0.7\" condition=\"overlay && bg.type !== 'color'\">\n    </mbr-parameters>\n\n    <div class=\"mbr-fallback-image disabled\" mbr-if=\"bg.type == 'video'\"></div>\n    <div class=\"mbr-overlay\" mbr-if=\"overlay && bg.type!== 'color'\" mbr-style=\"{'opacity': overlayOpacity, 'background-color': overlayColor}\">\n    </div>\n    <div mbr-class=\"{'container': !fullWidth, 'container-fluid': fullWidth}\">\n        <div class=\"row justify-content-center\">\n            <div class=\"title col-md-12 col-lg-{{textWidth}}\">\n                <h3 class=\"mbr-section-title mbr-fonts-style align-center mb-4\" mbr-if=\"showTitle\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-section-title\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-2\">\n                    <b>How Does Quietum Plus Works?</b></h3>\n                <h2 class=\"mbr-section-subtitle align-center mbr-fonts-style mb-4\" mbr-if=\"showSubtitle\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-section-subtitle\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\"><div><span style=\"font-size: 1.4rem;\"><br></span></div><div><b>Phytomem One™ </b>is formulated as a daily wellness supplement combining botanical extracts and nutritional compounds to support cognitive health, mental performance, antioxidant protection, and overall well-being. Its multi-ingredient approach is designed to complement a healthy lifestyle and consistent daily routine.</div><div><b><br></b></div><div><div>✅<b>Supports Memory and Cognitive Wellness–</b>&nbsp;Phytomem One™ is designed to provide nutritional support for normal memory and cognitive function. Its botanical ingredients, including saffron and other plant-derived compounds, are incorporated into a formula intended to support everyday brain wellness.</div><div><b><br></b></div></div><div><div><b>✅Promotes Mental Clarity –</b>&nbsp;Maintaining clear thinking can be important for work, learning, planning, and everyday activities. Phytomem One provides a combination of ingredients intended to complement normal cognitive performance and help support a clear, focused mind.</div></div><div><div><br></div></div><div><div>✅<b>Supports Focus and Concentration&nbsp;–</b>&nbsp;The formula is designed for adults who want daily nutritional support for concentration. By incorporating multiple botanical compounds into one convenient supplement, Phytomem One can become part of a consistent routine focused on maintaining mental performance.</div></div><div><div><br></div></div><div><div><span style=\"font-size: 1.4rem;\">✅P<b>rovides Antioxidant Support</b></span><b style=\"font-size: 1.4rem;\">&nbsp;–</b><span style=\"font-size: 1.4rem;\">&nbsp;Several ingredients in Phytomem One, including saffron, olive leaf extract, fucoxanthin, and citrus-derived compounds, contain naturally occurring antioxidant constituents. Antioxidants help support the body's natural defenses against oxidative stress and contribute to overall cellular wellness.</span></div></div><div><div><span style=\"font-size: 1.4rem;\"><br></span></div></div><div><div>✅<b>Supports Healthy Metabolic Function–</b>Ingredients such as berberine, Ceylon cinnamon, and corosolic acid have been studied in connection with metabolic processes. Their inclusion gives the formula a broader wellness focus that extends beyond cognitive support to healthy metabolic function.</div></div><div><div><br></div></div><div><div>✅<b>Supports Overall Cellular Wellness</b>&nbsp;<b>–</b>&nbsp;The combination of plant-derived compounds and antioxidant-rich ingredients is intended to complement normal cellular function. Supporting healthy cells is an important part of maintaining overall wellness and everyday vitality.</div></div><div><div><br></div></div><div><div>✅<b>Convenient Daily Wellness Support&nbsp;–</b>Instead of combining several individual botanical supplements, Phytomem One brings multiple ingredients together in a single formula. This makes it convenient for adults looking to maintain a simple and consistent daily wellness routine.</div></div><br><div><div>✅<b>Complements a Healthy Lifestyle</b><span style=\"font-size: 1.4rem;\"><b>–</b>Phytomem One™ can be incorporated into a broader approach to wellness that includes balanced nutrition, regular physical activity, quality sleep, adequate hydration, and mentally engaging activities. It is intended as nutritional support rather than a replacement for healthy habits or medical care.</span></div></div><br><div><div><span style=\"font-size: 1.4rem;\"><br></span></div></div></h2>\n                <div class=\"mbr-section-btn align-center\" mbr-if=\"showButtons\" mbr-buttons mbr-theme-style=\"display-4\">\n                    <a class=\"btn btn-primary\" href=\"https://mobiri.se\">LEARN MORE</a>\n                    <a class=\"btn btn-primary-outline\" href=\"https://mobiri.se\">LIVE DEMO</a>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n</section>",
